* From J. C. Shaw, "JOSS: Examples of the Use of an Experimental On-Line Computing Service", RAND P-3131, April 1965, page 5.
*  Root finding:

1.1 Set w=y.
1.2 Do part 2 for x=x+d.
1.3 Set d=d·y/(w-y).
1.4 To part 1 if |y|≥e.
1.5 Type "Root".

2.1 Set y=exp(x)-20·log(x).
2.2 Type x,y in form 1.

